{"speciesId":289,"names":{"fr":"Monaflèmit","es":"Slaking","en":"Slaking","ja":"ケッキング"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SLAKING spends all day lying down and lolling about. It eats grass growing within its reach. If it eats all the grass it can reach, this POKéMON reluctantly moves to another spot."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"Wherever SLAKING live, rings of over a yard in diameter appear in grassy fields. They are made by the POKéMON as it eats all the grass within reach while lying prone on the ground."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Hordes of SLAKING gather around trees when fruits come into season. They wait around patiently for ripened fruits to fall out of the trees."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is the world’s most slothful POKéMON. However, it can exert horrifying power by releasing pent-up energy all at once."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It is the world’s most slothful POKéMON. However, it can exert horrifying power by releasing pent-up energy all at once."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"The world’s laziest Pokémon. When it is lounging, it is actually saving energy for striking back."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"The world’s laziest Pokémon. When it is lounging, it is actually saving energy for striking back."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The world’s laziest Pokémon. When it is lounging, it is actually saving energy for striking back."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"The world’s laziest Pokémon. It moves to another spot when there’s no food left within its reach."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"The world’s laziest Pokémon. It moves to another spot when there’s no food left within its reach."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Le Pokémon le plus fainéant du monde. Il s’allonge pour économiser ses forces et contre-attaquer."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The world’s laziest Pokémon. When it is lounging, it is actually saving energy for striking back."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Le Pokémon le plus fainéant du monde. Il s’allonge pour économiser ses forces et contre-attaquer."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The world’s laziest Pokémon. When it is lounging, it is actually saving energy for striking back."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"This Pokémon lives lying on its side. It only rolls over and moves when there is no more grass to eat."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"This Pokémon lives lying on its side. It only rolls over and moves when there is no more grass to eat."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Le Pokémon le plus fainéant du monde. Il bouge quand il a mangé tout ce qui était à portée de main."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"El Pokémon más perezoso del mundo. Cambia de lugar para coger la comida al alcance de su mano."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The world’s laziest Pokémon. It moves to another spot when there’s no food left within its reach."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"世界一 ぐうたらな ポケモン。 手が 届く 範囲の エサを 食べつくすと 居場所を 替える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"C’est le Pokémon le plus paresseux du monde. Il est cependant capable de libérer une puissance phénoménale en une seule attaque."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Es el Pokémon más vago que hay. Aun así, puede liberar de una vez una cantidad tremenda de energía acumulada."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It is the world’s most slothful Pokémon. However, it can exert horrifying power by releasing pent-up energy all at once."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"世界一の ぐうたらだが たまった エネルギーを 一気に 出す ことで 恐ろしい パワーを 発揮する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Monaflèmit passe toute sa journée allongé à paresser. Il mange toute l’herbe qu’il trouve à portée de main. Ensuite, il change d’endroit, à contrecœur."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Slaking se pasa todo el día tumbado vagueando. Se come la hierba que tiene a su alcance y, una vez que ha acabado con ella, se va de mala gana a otro sitio."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Slaking spends all day lying down and lolling about. It eats grass growing within its reach. If it eats all the grass it can reach, this Pokémon reluctantly moves to another spot."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"１日中 寝そべったまま 暮らす ポケモン。 手の 届く 場所に 生えている 草を 食べ 草が なくなると しぶしぶ 場所を 変える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On trouve parfois des cercles de plus de 1 m de rayon totalement désherbés dans les plaines. Ils sont faits par les Monaflèmit qui passent leurs journées allongés à manger toute l’herbe à portée de main."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando Slaking se instala a vivir en una zona, aparecen círculos de un metro de radio de terreno baldío, pues se come todo el césped que pilla mientras está tumbado boca abajo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Wherever Slaking live, rings of over a yard in diameter appear in grassy fields. They are made by the Pokémon as it eats all the grass within reach while lying prone on the ground."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"草原に 刻まれた 半径 １メートルの 輪っかは ケッキングが 寝そべったまま 周りの 草を 食べ尽くして できた ものだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":289,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"scratch","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[